              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#HigherPrequantizationByDeligneCocycles"}
              describes lifts of the form
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
