          %p
            This way there is an immediate generalization of def.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CechDelignePrequantizationAnditsInfinitesimalAutomorpisms"}
            to forms and cocycles of higher degree:
          #PoissondgAlgebra.num_defn
            %h6#definition_13 Definition
            %p
              Let
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
