                      %msup
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %mi deg
                      %mi δ
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} d_{tot} = d + (-1)^{deg} \delta
            %p
              The non-vanishing dg-Lie brackets on this complex are given by the evident
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/action"} action
              of
