                    %mi L
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mspace{:width => "thinmathspace"}
                  %mo .
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                  \\mathfrak{bps}(X,\mathbf{L})
                  \\coloneqq
                  \\mathfrak{quantmorph}(X,\mathbf{L})
                  \\,.
          %p
            From this perspective the higher Kostant-Souriau extesion as in prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#HpExtensionFromTruncatedHigherPoissonBracket"}
            says the following:
